              "parentStyle": false,
              "containerChangeable": true,
              "containerExtending": true,
              "left": 40,
              "top": 640,
              "width": 790,
              "height": 189,
              "autoResize": false,
              "stereotypeDisplay": "label",
              "wordWrap": true,
              "text": "Reading guide\nOne k3s node runs ns campaign (finder, apply-worker, campaign-api,\nkafka-0, mongo-0, msrouter) and ns default (lubuntu-agent).\nImages are built on the host with docker and imported with\nk3s ctr images import; there is no registry.\nmsrouter is pinned to 0 replicas and finder runs with\nFINDER_SCORING_ENABLED=false while the pipeline is paused.\napply-worker reaches Chrome over CDP at the node IP\nport 30922 (NodePort 9222:30922).\nHost data lives under /home/mstro/k3s-pod-data, owned by mstro.\nThe laptop host sshd does not auto-start after a reboot.",
              "horzAlign": 0,
              "vertAlign": 0
            },
